OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry bright day
OL,6,Fwith plenty of sunshine developing,
OL,7,Falong with some areas of cloud. A
OL,8,Ffrosty start then a slightly less cold
OL,9,Fday for most.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening and night with
OL,12,Fsome long clear periods. Frost will
OL,13,Fdevelop and will become moderate to
OL,14,Fsevere in sheltered spots in the west,
OL,15,Fperhaps some fog patches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAnother dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith some long sunny spells. Rather
OL,19,Fcold with frost early and late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
