OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,7,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain
OL,8,Flingering into Wednesday in east,
OL,9,Fdying out later then mainly dry on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
